cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "mdcx: verified conversion of document collections to queryable Markdown"
message: "If you use this software in published work, please cite the entry below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ellena
    given-names: Jorge
repository-code: "https://github.com/jorgell23-sys/mdcx"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22015991
abstract: >-
  Converts complete document collections to Markdown, checking each file against
  the text the original actually exposes, packages the resulting corpus with its
  index and provenance into a single encrypted file, and exposes it to agents
  through the Model Context Protocol. Over a collection of 99 documents, answering
  one query through the package costs 435 model tokens against the 2,265,488
  required to read the originals.
keywords:
  - document conversion
  - markdown
  - retrieval
  - model context protocol
  - provenance
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.6
date-released: "2026-08-19"
